# The backend image builds from the repo root (it needs the root Directory.Build.props and global.json).
# Allow-list only what it needs.
*
!Directory.Build.props
!global.json
# The analyzer settings, including the exemption for EF's generated migrations. Without it the publish
# inside the image is held to different rules than the build outside it, and fails on generated code.
!.editorconfig
# ST-063: the note prompt is embedded in the API assembly, so it is an input to this build. Only the
# prompt itself — the fixtures, the eval harness and the virtualenv beside it are not.
!research/
research/*
!research/prompts/
research/prompts/*
!research/prompts/note_v1.md

!backend/
backend/**/bin/
backend/**/obj/
backend/tests/
